CRI-SPA transfers the four-gene betalain cassette into every YKO strain;
CGT predicts production from genotype on a fixed cassette background.

OPTIONS IF NEEDED: beta-carotene (Ozaydin) as a second product; isobutanol
(Lopez) as a third; the iBioFoundry design loop as the outer cycle." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="15.7" y="35.4" width="685.0" height="133.9" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="15.7" y="185.0" width="338.3" height="98.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="b  betaxanthin performance vs its 0.914 ceiling (0.48 scale)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Arial;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="15.7" y="169.3" width="346.5" height="15.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="376.0" y="185.0" width="338.3" height="86.9" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="c  amino-acid coupling (0.48 scale)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Arial;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="376.0" y="169.3" width="346.5" height="15.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="d  Combination

